        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Analogously to what has been observed in the previous scenario, when evidence on a node is provided, information propagates across the whole network affecting GEI not only directly, but also through all the other variables in the model, fully exploiting the multivariate vocation of OOBNs. Setting income equality to its highest level is in fact associated with improved conditions in nearly all other domains, indicating that enhancements in one dimension of",
